flowchart RL
    N0{Store done}
    N1[Emit]
    N2[Store report]
    N3(Retry)
    N4{Retry}
    N5([Load])
    N6(Notify notify)
    N7(Report)
    N8(Check)
    N9{Store}
    N0 --> N1
    N0 --> N2
    N2 --> N3
    N1 -->|yes| N4
    N2 -->|next| N5
    N5 -->|no| N6
    N5 --> N7
    N7 -->|ok| N8
    N6 --> N9
    N5 -->|again| N3
    N9 ==>|again| N6
